  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nIt's not enough to just go fast - you've got to go really, really fast. You're one step closer to that goal with your newly improved designs."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\nただ速いだけでは足りない。もっと、もっと速くなければ。新しい改良設計で、その目標に一歩近付いた。"
