  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThe universe can be a dangerous place, but not if you've got a really big gun. You can make even better mech weapons."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n宇宙は危険な場所だ。だが、本当に大きな銃があれば話は別。さらに優れたメック用武器を作れるようになる。"
