    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThe way you see it, there's no reason to own a mech if you can't strap a BFG to it and go to town on someone (or something) that deserves it. Your newest death-dealing mech weapons are perfect for doing just that."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 5^reset;\n\nBFGを載せて、痛い目に遭って当然の相手を蹴散らせないなら、メックを持つ意味などない。それがあなたの考えだ。新しい必殺のメック武装は、その目的にぴったりだ。"
