    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/0",
      "value": "音楽"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou can now create a variety of music boxes at your Tinkering Table. These can play any music from Starbound, Frackin' Universe or the add-on Frackin' Music, if you have it installed."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 1^reset;\n\n改造作業台で、さまざまなミュージックボックスを作れるようになる。StarboundやFrackin' Universeの全楽曲に加え、追加MODのFrackin' Musicを導入していれば、その曲も再生できる。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/0",
      "value": "Energy Cores"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/0",
      "value": "エネルギーコア"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a trio of powerful energy cores, each with their own laundry list of scientific and military applications. Molten Cores are excellent when dealing with intense heat such as in blast furnaces or lava-spewing flamethrowers. Power Cores shine in kinetic applications, and are useful in machines with many moving parts and high-end ballistic weaponry. Nuclear Cores are useful for channeling radiation, such as in a fission reactor, or just plain making tons of energy for high-demand inventions."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\n三種類の強力なエネルギーコアを設計した。それぞれに、科学や軍事の多くの用途がある。溶融コアは、溶鉱炉や溶岩を噴く火炎放射器など、激しい熱を扱う用途に優れる。パワーコアは運動エネルギーを扱う分野で真価を発揮し、可動部の多い機械や高性能な実弾兵器に役立つ。核コアは、核分裂炉のように放射線を扱ったり、大量のエネルギーを必要とする発明品に電力を供給したりするのに向いている。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/0",
      "value": "Improved Cores"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/0",
      "value": "コアの改良"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour skill with compact power sources has allowed you to make two more useful cores, expanding your engineering capability greatly. Teleporter Cores are perfect for transportation and constructing large, automated item networks, while Particle Cores are unmatched at channeling atomic and subatomic particles - the photons in a powerful laser, for example."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 4^reset;\n\n小型電源の技術により、さらに二種類の役立つコアを作れるようになり、工学の可能性が大きく広がる。テレポーターコアは輸送や、大規模な自動アイテム搬送網の構築に最適だ。一方、粒子コアは、強力なレーザーの光子など、原子や亜原子粒子を制御する能力に並ぶものがない。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/0",
      "value": "Protocite Circuits"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/0",
      "value": "プロトサイトの回路"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've put the insane energy-transferring properties of Protocite to work in highly complex processors which work with quantum bits - no longer just 1 or 0, but sometimes both! Quantum Procesors have many uses in higher-end electronics."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 3^reset;\n\nプロトサイトの驚異的なエネルギー伝達能力を、量子ビットを扱う高度なプロセッサーへ応用した。もはや1か0かだけではない。同時に両方の状態も取れる！ 量子プロセッサーは、高度な電子機器で幅広く役立つ。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
