  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe science behind Erchius Crystals is still very vague, but one thing is known for certain: these crystals hold the key to FTL travel. With the ability to make your own FTL drives, the whole galaxy is now open to exploration.\n\nWhen Erchius-based drives were still in their infancy, only Erchius fuel could power FTL travel. However, it has since been discovered how to fuel drives with a variety of sources such as ^green;radioactive isotopes^reset; or ^green;biofuel^reset;."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/1",
      "value": "^orange;ティア 2^reset;\n\nエルキウス結晶の仕組みには、まだ不明な点が多い。それでも、FTL航行の鍵を握ることだけは確かだ。FTLドライブを自作できるようになれば、銀河全体が探索の舞台となる。\n\nエルキウス式ドライブの黎明期には、FTL航行に使えるのはエルキウス燃料だけだった。しかし今では、^green;放射性同位体^reset;や^green;バイオ燃料^reset;など、さまざまなエネルギー源を利用する方法が知られている。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
