  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning that engineering isn't just about making new things, but improving on the ones you already made. To this end, you've learned to create a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; which will allow you to make EPP modules, mining gear, special weapon upgrades, and useful tools such as a Hookshot or Mining Laser."
